{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"rhyme-brush-brush-brush","version":1,"title":"Brush, Brush, Brush (a tooth-brushing chant)","ageTiers":["3-4","5-6"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Brush, brush, brush in the morning light,\nup and down, left and right.","sentences":["Brush, brush, brush in the morning light,\nup and down, left and right."],"alt":"A child brushing teeth in the morning.","image":{"hash":"sha256:7ae6a33d4584712c4d3af9861b70da7d1ef2b6e22d12833fe48008480d72ddb4","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:afc135f9f7d8a3ac592365ea625b1478143d7965a44834569d8466de0a53eb7b","durationMs":8800,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,8800]],"words":[[0,915],[915,1830],[1830,2534],[2534,2816],[2816,3238],[3238,4224],[4224,5139],[5139,5421],[5421,5843],[5843,6618],[6618,7181],[7181,7603],[7603,8800]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Little teeth, little teeth, all in a row.\nBrush them gently, nice and slow.","sentences":["Little teeth, little teeth, all in a row.","Brush them gently, nice and slow."],"alt":"A child smiling to show clean teeth.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b6a8fdbce2b9d97330c6c3f59b924ff22d04cb5edfc54a6743d22273575a2a53","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:aafb5777f3e3918f06d820f90cf007593712fcb0e8583ad3451192b4dcc8e4ba","durationMs":8200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4377],[4377,8200]],"words":[[0,740],[740,1541],[1541,2281],[2281,3083],[3083,3453],[3453,3699],[3699,3823],[3823,4377],[4377,4994],[4994,5487],[5487,6412],[6412,6905],[6905,7275],[7275,8200]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Brush, brush, brush when the day is done.\nBefore we sleep, we brush each one.","sentences":["Brush, brush, brush when the day is done.","Before we sleep, we brush each one."],"alt":"A child brushing teeth at night.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d2ef4167586cae5738bc48d17dbe9ba5b17f4f9f82edc3480ed019c2d353534f","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"